2	 * The room of editors — system prompt builder and the local fallback
3	 * generator. The Convex action in `convex/agents.ts` calls into this module
4	 * when no remote provider is configured, or when the configured provider
5	 * fails. The prompt builder is also reused by the LLM-backed code path so
6	 * the voices stay consistent across providers.
7	 *
8	 * Intentionally no `"use node";` directive: this file is pure string
9	 * assembly with no Node.js built-ins, and it is also imported by the
