8	 *   - `brief`             : keyPath "folioId"  (the project brief, per folio)
9	 *   - `comments`          : keyPath "id"       (user inline comments)
10	 *   - `personas`          : keyPath "id"       (writer's saved persona set)
11	 *   - `meta`              : keyPath "key"      (active folio id, etc.)
12	 *   - `ai-settings`       : keyPath "key"      (single "current" key)
13	 *   - `lix-blob`          : keyPath "key"      (single "current" key)
